        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Woodstock%2C_Illinois"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "Woodstock was founded as Centerville in 1844 and became the county seat of McHenry County.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        12
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://woodstockil.gov/482/Woodstock-History"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The historic downtown Square anchors the Woodstock Opera House and the Old McHenry County Courthouse, both on the National Register.",
